        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86459, Modern Hexagon Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 7 different sizes ranging from 5-3/8 inches to 14-1/4 inches long, the Modern Hex Cabinet Pull is as versatile as it is stylish. This Hexagon Cabinet Pull is not just for the kitchen, it can be used as a pull on any lightweight door or drawer. Emtek's Mod Hex Cabinet Knob is available in several modern finish color options. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-hex-cabinet-knob-emtek-86457\"><b>Modern Hex Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/modern-hex-appliance-pull-emtek-ap-87003\"><b>Modern Hex Appliance Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/modern-hex-thru-bolt-pull-emtek-87003\"><b>Modern Hex Thru-Bolt Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Mod Hex Cabinet xPull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86459-specifications.pdf?v=1704262405\"><b>Emtek Mod Hex Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86459:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86460:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86679:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86461:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86462:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86680:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86681:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
